  "name": "Invisibility Cloak (Su)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Engineer 4</p><p>The engineer creates a cloak that bends light and effectively turns him invisible. Activating the cloak is a standard action and hides the engineer as the Vanish spell using the engineer's level as the caster level. The engineer can use this cloak once per day + an additional time per day for every 4 engineer levels after 4th level, before it must be recharged. The cloak can be recharged by exposing it to sunlight for 8 hours. This gadget takes up the engineer's shoulder item slot.</p>",
